{"path":"experimental/fs/path/root_path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::root_path","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::filesystem::path::</span>root_path","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/root_path","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the root path of the path. If the path does not include root path, returns path().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-fs_ts\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path root_path<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-fs-ts t-mark-ts\">(filesystem TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the root path of the path. If the path does not include root path, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">path<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>Effectively, returns the following:\n<span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">root_name<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">/</span> root_directory<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The root path of the path.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Current root path is: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">root_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Current root path is: \"C:\\\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/root_name\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>root_name</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the root-name of the path, if present <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/fs/path/root_directory\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>root_directory</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the root directory of the path, if present <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/fs","title":"Filesystem library"},{"path":"experimental/fs/path","title":"std::experimental::filesystem::path"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::filesystem::path::root_path","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the root path of the path. If the path does not include root path, returns path()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The root path of the path."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"root_name","note":"returns the root-name of the path, if present"},{"label":"root_directory","note":"returns the root directory of the path, if present"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":102,"codeBlockCount":2}
